\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-405\li720\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par   \cf0  1. \tab Jesus is my only travelling partner,
\par \pard\li720\sl202\slmult0\qj Daily do we both go out together
\par Jesus is my only safe travel guide,
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\qj In Him I receive  abundant grace
\par :\i /:  In Him I receive abundant grace :/:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par    2. \tab In  the forests, mountains and in valleys
\par \pard\li720\sl202\slmult0\qj In the deserts, oceans, everywhere,
\par He holds my hand and makes me walk  gently,
\par \i :/: He shall take me to His home above :/:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li720\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.When at night I go to bed, He guards me,
\par \pard\li720\sl202\slmult0\qj When I wake up, here I have my friend,
\par When I trespass, He with patience leads  me;
\par \i :/: When I'm weary, He does strengthen me :/:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par                4. I watch Jesus only on my journey
\par \pard\li720\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1 He is my food and  all that I drink\cf0 
\par \pard\li144\sl202\slmult0\qj\tab  Him alone do I have my perfect peace
\par \i\tab :/: He Protects my body and my soul. :/:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\li288\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     5.  \tab And when death does get closer and closer
\par \pard\li144\sl202\slmult0\qj\tab He will call me to come unto Him
\par \tab I shall go and enter His peace domain
\par \i\tab :/: And I shall join with His heav'nly Saints :/:\i0\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

